==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Wind]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[White Wind]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Wind]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[White Wind]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[White Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Red Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage, even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemy serves practically no threat at all. Although it is recommended to have them to beat at least at level 1+5 so that they have some survivability.

